abstract: "Replication code for the revised manuscript: preprocessing, the topological verification pipeline (eight methods on FVC2000 DB1 and FVC2002 DB3), the NBIS reference matcher, finger-level bootstrap intervals, the DB1-to-DB3 transfer, the fixed-model sensitivity experiment, the cubical-construction comparison, and the scripts that regenerate every table and figure. The DOI above is the Zenodo concept DOI, which resolves to the latest version; the version-specific DOI of release 1.1.0 is minted by Zenodo when the GitHub release is published."
